---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us — Delta Force Hawk Ops Guide"
  description="Get in touch with the Delta Force Hawk Ops Guide team. Send feedback, suggestions, or questions about our guides."
  canonical="https://game-delta.asia/contact.html"
  currentPage="contact"
>
  <main class="article-page">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">›</span>
        <span>Contact</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="article-content">
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p>Have questions, suggestions, or feedback about our guides? We'd love to hear from you. Reach out through any of the methods below.</p>

        <h2 id="email">Email</h2>
        <p><strong>ben357753@163.com</strong></p>
        <p>We typically respond within 48 hours. For urgent matters like major guide errors, mention it in the subject line.</p>

        <h2 id="feedback">Feedback & Suggestions</h2>
        <p>If you found an error in one of our guides or have a suggestion for improvement, please include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The page URL where you found the issue</li>
          <li>A description of the problem or suggestion</li>
          <li>Any supporting information (screenshots, data, etc.)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="contributions">Contributions</h2>
        <p>We welcome community contributions! If you have expertise in a specific operator, map, weapon, or strategy, reach out with the subject "Want to Contribute." We look for contributors with significant gameplay experience who can provide data-backed information.</p>

        <div class="callout callout-info">
          <div class="callout-title">ℹ️ Note</div>
          <p>This is a fan-made website. For official game support, bugs, or technical issues, please contact the official Delta Force: Hawk Ops support channels.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
